*******1. Login Page********

START

DISPLAY Login Page

ASK user to enter:
    Email
    Password

DISPLAY:
    Sign In
    Forgot Password?
    Sign Up

IF user clicks "Sign Up" THEN
    GO TO Registration Page
END IF

IF user clicks "Forgot Password?" THEN
    GO TO Forgot Password Page
END IF

IF user clicks "Sign In" THEN

    GET Email
    GET Password

    IF Email is empty OR Password is empty THEN

        DISPLAY "Please enter your email and password"

    ELSE

        SEND Email and Password
        TO Firebase Authentication

        IF Firebase Authentication is successful THEN

            GET authenticated user's UID

            SEND UID TO Firebase Realtime Database

            RETRIEVE user's account type

            IF account type = "Learner" THEN
                GO TO Learner Dashboard

            ELSE IF account type = "Facilitator" THEN
                GO TO Facilitator Dashboard

            ELSE
                DISPLAY "Account type not recognised"
            END IF

        ELSE

            DISPLAY "Invalid email or password"

        END IF

    END IF

END IF

*********2. Registration and OTP**********

DISPLAY Registration Page

ASK user to enter:

    Email
    Username
    Phone Number
    Account Type
    Password

DISPLAY:

    Learner
    Facilitator

IF user clicks "Create Account" THEN

    GET all registration information

    VALIDATE registration information

    IF any required field is empty THEN

        DISPLAY "Please complete all fields"

    ELSE IF password is less than 6 characters THEN

        DISPLAY "Password must contain at least 6 characters"

    ELSE

        SEND Email and Password
        TO Firebase Authentication

        IF account creation is successful THEN

            RECEIVE Firebase User UID

            BEGIN verification process

            IF Phone OTP is selected THEN
                SEND OTP to user's phone
            ELSE IF Email verification is selected THEN
                SEND verification request/email
            END IF

            DISPLAY Verification Page

            ASK user to enter verification code
            OR complete email verification

            IF verification is successful THEN

                SAVE user information
                TO Firebase Realtime Database

                STORE:
                    UID
                    Username
                    Email
                    Phone Number
                    Account Type

                DISPLAY "Account created successfully"

                GO TO Login Page

            ELSE

                DISPLAY "Incorrect verification code"

                ALLOW user to request another code

            END IF

        ELSE

            DISPLAY Firebase registration error

        END IF

    END IF

END IF

**********3. Forgot / Reset Password************

DISPLAY Forgot Password Page

ASK user to enter:

    Email

IF user clicks "Reset Password" THEN

    VALIDATE Email

    IF Email is empty THEN

        DISPLAY "Please enter your email"

    ELSE

        SEND password reset request
        TO Firebase Authentication

        IF Firebase accepts the request THEN

            SEND password reset email
            TO user

            DISPLAY
            "Password reset instructions have been sent"

            GO TO Login Page

        ELSE

            DISPLAY
            "Unable to process password reset"

        END IF

    END IF

END IF

************4. Return to Login***********

IF registration is successful THEN
    RETURN to Login Page
END IF

IF password reset is successful THEN
    RETURN to Login Page
END IF

DISPLAY:
    Email field
    Password field
    Sign In button
    Sign Up option
    Forgot Password option


************5. Firebase Processing**********

WHEN the user submits information:

    JAVASCRIPT receives the form data

    VALIDATE the information

    SEND request through Firebase SDK

    FIREBASE AUTHENTICATION:
        Create account
        Verify account
        Login user
        Reset password

    FIREBASE REALTIME DATABASE:
        Store user information
        Retrieve user information

    FIREBASE returns a response

    JAVASCRIPT receives the response

    IF response is successful THEN
        UPDATE the webpage
        DISPLAY success message
        REDIRECT user to the correct dashboard

    ELSE
        DISPLAY an error message
    END IF


************6. Dashboard***********

IF Firebase Authentication confirms successful login THEN

    RETRIEVE user's account type from Firebase

    IF account type = "Learner" THEN
        DISPLAY Learner Dashboard

    ELSE IF account type = "Facilitator" THEN
        DISPLAY Facilitator Dashboard
    END IF

END IF

END

